('concept.greek.eleusinian_secrecy','Eleusinian ritual secrecy','厄琉息斯仪式保密原则',NULL,NULL,'CONCEPT','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Archaic textual witness and later reception','用于标记古代文本所述的不可泄露性及现代证据边界；不重构未公开的秘仪内容。 / Records ancient claims of restricted disclosure and the modern evidentiary limit without reconstructing secret rites.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"methodological_guardrail":"absence of public detail is not permission to invent"}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('hero.greek.triptolemos','Triptolemos','特里普托勒摩斯','Τριπτόλεμος','Triptolemos','HERO','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Archaic and Classical Greek witnesses','《得墨忒耳颂歌》与厄琉息斯图像中的英雄人物；不同传统版本继续分层。 / Hero attested in the Hymn to Demeter and Eleusinian imagery; variant traditions remain open.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('ritual.greek.eleusinian_mysteries','Eleusinian Mysteries','厄琉息斯秘仪','Ἐλευσίνια Μυστήρια','Eleusinia Mysteria','RITUAL','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Archaic through Roman-period evidence layers','与得墨忒耳、珀耳塞福涅和厄琉息斯圣所有关的历史仪式传统；公开证据与秘密内容严格区分。 / Historical ritual tradition linked to Demeter, Persephone and Eleusis; public evidence is separated from unrecoverable secret content.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"reality_status":"HISTORICAL_RITUAL","secret_content":"NOT_RECONSTRUCTED"}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('festival.greek.great_eleusinia','Great Eleusinia','大厄琉息斯节','Μεγάλα Ἐλευσίνια','Megala Eleusinia','FESTIVAL','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Classical and later public festival layers','从雅典沿圣道前往厄琉息斯的公共节庆／行列层；不等同于秘仪内部全部活动。 / Public festival and procession layer from Athens along the Sacred Way, distinct from all inner initiatory acts.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"scope":"public procession layer"}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('site.greece.eleusis_telesterion','Telesterion at Eleusis','厄琉息斯特勒斯特里翁仪式厅','Τελεστήριον','Telesterion','ARCHAEOLOGICAL_SITE','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Multiple building phases; surviving foundations','厄琉息斯圣所内用于仪式集会的建筑子实体；仅保存可公开验证的考古结构。 / Monument-level subrecord for the assembly hall within the sanctuary, limited to public archaeological evidence.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"reality_status":"REAL_ARCHAEOLOGICAL","part_of":"site.greece.eleusis"}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('site.greece.sacred_way','Sacred Way from Athens to Eleusis','雅典至厄琉息斯圣道','Ἱερὰ Ὁδός','Hiera Hodos','ARCHAEOLOGICAL_SITE','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Ancient route with surviving monuments','连接雅典与厄琉息斯的现实古代道路及仪式行列路线。 / Real ancient road and processional route connecting Athens and Eleusis.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"reality_status":"REAL_ARCHAEOLOGICAL","route_model":"period-sensitive"}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('text.greek.ieleusis97','I.Eleusis 97','《厄琉息斯铭文集》97号',NULL,NULL,'INSCRIPTION','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','321/0 BCE','奉献给得墨忒耳与科瑞的厄琉息斯铭文，保存官员与雕刻者信息。 / Eleusinian dedication to Demeter and Kore naming an official and sculptor.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"catalogue_concordance":["I.Eleusis 97","IG II² 2841","IG II³,4 213"]}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('institution.nam_athens','National Archaeological Museum, Athens','雅典国家考古博物馆',NULL,NULL,'INSTITUTION','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Modern museum institution','收藏大厄琉息斯浮雕126号的现代博物馆机构。 / Modern holding institution for the Great Eleusinian Relief no. 126.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('museum.nam.great_eleusinian_relief_126','Great Eleusinian Relief no. 126','大厄琉息斯浮雕126号',NULL,NULL,'MUSEUM_OBJECT','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Classical period, ca. 440-430 BCE','厄琉息斯出土的大型浮雕，博物馆目录识别得墨忒耳、珀耳塞福涅与特里普托勒摩斯。 / Monumental relief from Eleusis catalogued with Demeter, Persephone and Triptolemos.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"catalogue_number":"126"}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z'),
('museum.met.eleusinian_relief_14_130_9','Roman fragments of the Great Eleusinian Relief 14.130.9','大厄琉息斯浮雕罗马摹本残片14.130.9',NULL,NULL,'MUSEUM_OBJECT','civ.greek','region.mediterranean','Roman, ca. 27 BCE-14 CE','大都会艺术博物馆藏十块罗马大理石摹本残片，现嵌于原作石膏模型。 / Ten Roman marble copy fragments at The Met, set into a cast of the Greek relief.','PARTIAL','UNVERIFIED',1,'{"catalogue_number":"14.130.9","copy_status":"ROMAN_COPY_FRAGMENTS"}','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z','2026-08-21T00:00:00Z');

